WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.672 --> 00:00:16.600
"Why are you here, Rocket Girl?"

2
00:00:16.821 --> 00:00:17.781
Dr. Odd asked.

3
00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:20.203
Roxy didn't answer.

4
00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:21.864
She was shocked.

5
00:00:22.964 --> 00:00:24.285
She was so far from Earth.

6
00:00:25.506 --> 00:00:25.906
And Dr.

7
00:00:26.106 --> 00:00:29.028
Odd, one of the worst villains from Metro City, was here too!

8
00:00:30.432 --> 00:00:32.213
Cozlin looked from Roxy to Dr.

9
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.335
Odd. "You two know each other?"

10
00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:36.956
Roxy nodded.

11
00:00:36.976 --> 00:00:39.077
"His name is Dr.

12
00:00:39.357 --> 00:00:40.638
Odd, and he's evil."

13
00:00:40.658 --> 00:00:43.920
"I'm not evil anymore!"

14
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.240
Dr. Odd shouted.

15
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:49.403
"A judge released me from prison for good behavior!"

16
00:00:50.343 --> 00:00:51.524
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

17
00:00:51.544 --> 00:00:53.185
"Good behavior?

18
00:00:53.745 --> 00:00:55.386
What did you do that was so good?"

19
00:00:56.727 --> 00:00:58.227
Dr. Odd folded his arms.

20
00:00:59.636 --> 00:01:02.619
"I taught technology classes to the other prisoners.

21
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.541
I helped them get a decent education."

22
00:01:06.862 --> 00:01:07.683
Roxy snorted.

23
00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:10.245
"What were the technology classes about?

24
00:01:11.286 --> 00:01:13.468
How to take over a planet with robots?"

25
00:01:13.488 --> 00:01:16.070
"What are you talking about?"

26
00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:17.331
Dr. Odd asked.

27
00:01:17.351 --> 00:01:21.274
"Groon used to be a nice planet," Roxy said.

28
00:01:21.294 --> 00:01:24.877
"And it looks like you turned it into some sort of robot planet.

29
00:01:25.497 --> 00:01:27.139
You did this to other planets too!"

30
00:01:27.159 --> 00:01:29.709
"Yeah!" Cozlin said.

31
00:01:29.729 --> 00:01:31.250
"My planet!"

32
00:01:32.511 --> 00:01:33.852
"I didn't do that!"

33
00:01:34.152 --> 00:01:35.092
Dr. Odd shouted.

34
00:01:35.673 --> 00:01:36.814
He glared at Cozlin.

35
00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:38.935
"Who are you anyway?"

36
00:01:40.076 --> 00:01:41.397
Cozlin folded her arms.

37
00:01:41.417 --> 00:01:43.658
"I'm Kid Comet."

38
00:01:45.039 --> 00:01:47.041
Dr. Odd pointed to the sphere behind him.

39
00:01:47.061 --> 00:01:49.162
"That's my moon.

40
00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.865
I was living peacefully on it—alone.

41
00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.108
A magnetic force took control of it and brought me here.

42
00:02:00.637 --> 00:02:02.198
Now I'm stuck here!"

43
00:02:03.319 --> 00:02:04.540
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

44
00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.081
"I don't believe you.

45
00:02:06.441 --> 00:02:07.702
You're under arrest!"

46
00:02:09.203 --> 00:02:11.625
"You can't arrest me," the villain said.

47
00:02:11.645 --> 00:02:15.848
"I didn't do anything, and we're millions of light-years from Earth!"

48
00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:21.852
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams shot toward Dr.

49
00:02:21.912 --> 00:02:26.956
Odd. His robot's head snapped shut, hiding him.

50
00:02:29.912 --> 00:02:34.215
Zonk! The robot shot an energy blast at Roxy.

51
00:02:34.235 --> 00:02:36.757
She leaped out of the way as an old spaceship exploded.

52
00:02:39.278 --> 00:02:41.640
Bam! Cozlin punched the robot.

53
00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.441
"Gah!" Dr.

54
00:02:43.521 --> 00:02:45.903
Odd shouted as the robot nearly lost its balance.

55
00:02:46.823 --> 00:02:49.605
It spun around, swinging a huge fist toward Cozlin.

56
00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:53.848
"Yikes!" Cozlin landed next to a big rusty wheel.

57
00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.452
Zonk! An energy blast flew toward her.

58
00:03:00.364 --> 00:03:02.185
Cozlin quickly stepped through the wheel.

59
00:03:02.745 --> 00:03:06.886
Boom! She appeared on the other side as the blast hit an old rocket.

60
00:03:07.906 --> 00:03:09.987
The robot fired another energy blast.

61
00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:12.268
The wheel exploded.

62
00:03:13.488 --> 00:03:15.328
Roxy quickly knocked the robot over.

63
00:03:15.348 --> 00:03:18.089
"Argh!" Dr.

64
00:03:18.209 --> 00:03:18.810
Odd shouted.

65
00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.391
Pow! Cozlin slammed into the robot's side.

66
00:03:24.651 --> 00:03:27.984
The robot's leg swung, kicking Cozlin.

67
00:03:28.004 --> 00:03:30.665
Cozlin went tumbling into a pile of twisted scrap metal.

68
00:03:32.205 --> 00:03:34.886
As she struggled to get free, an arm grabbed her ankle.

69
00:03:35.886 --> 00:03:37.627
"Ahh!" Cozlin shouted.

70
00:03:37.647 --> 00:03:40.668
"This metal is turning into more robots!"

71
00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:43.789
Roxy flew over and grabbed her wrist.

72
00:03:43.809 --> 00:03:45.489
"Don't worry!"

73
00:03:45.869 --> 00:03:46.489
Roxy said.

74
00:03:46.509 --> 00:03:48.230
"I'll get you out of there!"

75
00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.211
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

76
00:03:53.011 --> 00:03:55.512
Slowly the robots and all the metal began to melt.

77
00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.021
Roxy pulled Cozlin free as the pile melted into a large puddle.

78
00:04:03.602 --> 00:04:04.502
Roxy looked around.

79
00:04:04.522 --> 00:04:06.223
"Where did Dr.

80
00:04:06.343 --> 00:04:06.843
Odd go?"

81
00:04:07.683 --> 00:04:08.523
Cozlin shrugged.

82
00:04:08.543 --> 00:04:09.784
"I don't know.

83
00:04:10.384 --> 00:04:13.104
But we need to get off this planet and form a new plan.

84
00:04:13.825 --> 00:04:15.425
We can't handle this alone."

85
00:04:16.926 --> 00:04:18.126
Roxy folded her arms.

86
00:04:18.146 --> 00:04:22.687
"Oh! Sounds like Kid Comet needs even more help now."

87
00:04:23.948 --> 00:04:25.068
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

88
00:04:26.092 --> 00:04:27.773
"Let's just go back to my ship."

89
00:04:32.135 --> 00:04:35.377
But when they got to the spaceship, both superheroes gasped.

90
00:04:35.397 --> 00:04:37.078
"Your ship!"

91
00:04:37.558 --> 00:04:38.238
Roxy said.

92
00:04:38.258 --> 00:04:40.740
"The robots took it apart!"
